Bind each pending recommendation to the current applicable policy edition, effective interval and signer authority. If the policy changed while approval waited, compare the changed rule with every condition and surviving safeguard; invalidate the affected pending signing recommendation until re-evaluated. Do not reuse a prior approval on new meaning. Preserve valid completed actions under their historical edition. Return precise affected conditions rather than automatically denying or grandfathering the entire case.
